%% Proposed architecture; not deployed in Phase 1
flowchart LR
 Visitor --> Amplify[React on Amplify]
 Amplify --> Cognito
 Amplify --> Gateway[API Gateway HTTP API]
 Gateway --> Link[VPC link]
 Link --> ALB[Internal ALB]
 ALB --> EKS[Microservices on EKS]
 EKS --> RDS[PostgreSQL RDS]
 EKS --> SQS
 SQS --> Worker[Analytics worker]
 Worker --> Reporting[SQL reporting schema]
 Reporting --> Metabase
 EKS --> CloudWatch
